  "properties": {
    "title": "QGIS2Mapbender QGIS Plugin - Publish your QGIS Project directly in Mapbender",
    "description": "QGIS2Mapbender is a brand new plugin that allows you to publish a QGIS project via QGIS Server and add it to a Mapbender application with just a few clicks in a plugin in your QGIS Desktop.\r\nCool solution. See how it works.\r\n\r\n- Find the code and documentation https://github.com/WhereGroup/QGIS2Mapbender/blob/main/README.md\r\n- Download the QGIS plugin https://plugins.qgis.org/plugins/qgis2mapbender/",
